# haoxiaoguan
===
 Hao Xiaoguan is a cross-platform desktop application built on Electron that aggregates various upstream AI providers (such as Kiro, native Codex/ChatGPT, and third-party proxies) into unified, local endpoints compatible with OpenAI, Anthropic, and Gemini APIs. It features multi-account pooling, quota management, one-click client integration, and usage analytics dashboards, enabling stable and controlled access to AI services within tools like Claude Code, Codex, and Gemini CLI.
